      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vernon%2C_British_Columbia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city’s name honors Forbes George Vernon, an MLA who helped establish Coldstream Ranch nearby.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vernon%2C_British_Columbia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Vernon sits beside Okanagan and Swan Lakes, where the Okanagan people first settled for seasonal food.",
